## What each axis FOUND (the thing a smarter question would have asked)
- CTX: the theory is not holes; it is that an installed program's meaning is a function of the World given by justifications (CMTT + ATMS + why-not provenance), and five of six nano pieces are one object, the SLOT. The property the readers could not name is stated: CONTEXTUAL INTEGRITY ∧ REPAIR. The second consumer (the document) runs over the real client in 5.6 s.
- TRUST: agreement as a kernel object (Head + Authority); fork consistency was cheaper than every reader priced because the chain already held half of it; the engine is only the committee's liveness and no verifier consults it; offline merge honestly NOT met.
- META: a generator is an ordinary package whose method returns install BYTES; the receipt IS the Turn; hygiene is free (closed de Bruijn); the honest limit: staging at the byte level, the code type is TYPES's.
- PCC: the kernel already checks one proof of every program (its type); a claim is a sentence checked beside it in one unmetered pass; a law costs 30–100 ticks so re-execution monitors per-step facts cheaply; a static proof buys a sentence the World refuses to let be false, not ticks; reflection avoided, not solved.
- AGENT: an LLM agent ALREADY IS a first-class member (no key; consent before signature; a Lean-decided broker charges the worst case first); the only gap was that a ring is the sole obligation; building corrected the design (the aim lives in the captured value; a separate relation read is fail-open when unpinned).
- OBS: only functions of the log are the World's to know; wall-clock is unknowable; the oracle is a World (E5), never a cell kind; the meter's premise price fell to zero by typing the window; the one remaining hypothesis on commutation is a theorem of the model, not a price.
- TYPES: effect types already exist ungraded (the method type IS an effect row); the grade was the missing half; linear value is a category error (a method never holds value); refinements in three tiers (install-decided / run-decided / proof-carried) is the TYPES/PCC boundary.

