decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-28 · row wrongWorld: the writer's whole log, replayed into a Store that differs only in its nonce, is refused `wrongWorld` call by call; the same nonce is a restore (2026-10-17, PROTOCOL-6; KERNEL-24 at 9e91ede)
