decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-32 · the ledger verbs `issue`, `account`, `transfer`, `credit`; rows `well` and `pay` on the receivers; a hostile client is a row act (2026-10-17, PROTOCOL-6; LEDGER-2's D5 at c3c7aa3, LEDGER-6 (f), LEDGER-7)
decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-33 · row forgotten: past KERNEL-33's prune a lookup is `uncertain forgotten`, never `refused`; `Expect.unsettled` names why (2026-10-17, PROTOCOL-6; KERNEL-33 at 17e2d3f, HOST's arm)
