decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-35 · row carry: export, import by digest, the carried World answers the old journal, an old-origin call is `wrongWorld` (2026-10-17, PROTOCOL-6; KERNEL-29 b8e0f82, CODEC-5 28b4a38, HOST-28 6b89d6f)
