decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-42 · an invitation: the joiner derives the World it joins from inputs a sponsor key it trusts signed; `invite`, `adopt INVITE KEY`, `host join`; row `invite` (2026-10-18, PROTOCOL-9; TRANSPORT's D7 and ASSEMBLY D1's open critique, with HOST-12)
