decisions/protocol.md:## PROTOCOL-44 · objects describe themselves: `read OBJ ?` prints an object's methods (index, label, argument type, call slots) and laws through the one printer; refusals print what to do next (2026-10-18, PROTOCOL-9; DELVETALK-LEARNINGS §4.3)
