decisions/lang.md:## LANG-86 A generator is a package whose method installs a package: `install` is a call an object may make, and `Std.headGenerator` is `Std.head` as an installed object (2026-10-26; FABLE-META, axis 1 of FRONTIER-AXES-20261026; design `redregg/work/promo/DESIGN-META.md`; with KERNEL-75)
