## KERNEL-43 · What bounds the allowance is storage PLUS allowance: genesis, carry and the World codec check the sum, and every reached World keeps it below 2^64
## KERNEL-44 PROPOSED · A refusal is a recorded system interaction, bounded per member per window; replay is bounded by a checkpoint rule
## KERNEL-45 PROPOSED · A Turn is the hyperedge for ONE signer; multi-signer and cross-World joint turns are DEFERRED with triggers
